Package: hydrodownloadR
Title: Hydrological Station Catalogs and Time Series from Public APIs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
     person("Henning", "Plessow", role = c("aut", "cre"),
            email = "h.plessow@googlemail.com"),
     person("Global Runoff Data Centre", role = "ctb",
            email = "grdc@bafg.de")
 )
Description: Provides a unified, extensible interface for discovering hydrological
    stations and downloading daily or monthly time series of water discharge, water
    level, water temperature and flow velocity from national and regional public APIs.
    Implements a provider registry with identifiers and S3 generics 'stations' and
    'timeseries'; supports date ranges or complete histories (from 1900-01-01),
    per-station selection, rate limiting and retries, optional authentication via
    environment variables, and tidy outputs. Includes UTF-8 to ASCII transliteration
    and coordinate transformation to WGS84. Designed for reproducible workflows and
    straightforward addition of new providers.
